Round-3 fix iteration -- FIND-101 (spec_fidelity, critical, independently confirmed).

FIND-101: lending-orchestrator.mjs:392 read `freshBorrower.agentId` (camelCase). The real, on-disk
citizen-registry row stores the borrower's ERC-8004 identity under snake_case `agent_id`
(canonical write site: skills/self/spawn/lib/child-spec.js:65 -- `spec.agent_id = agentId;`).
wake-gate.mjs's real production getCitizen closure (buildDefaultGetCitizen) spreads the raw registry
row unmodified (`{ ...citizen, balanceUsd }`, zero camelCase normalization anywhere in this repo). So
`freshBorrower.agentId` was ALWAYS undefined for every real borrower -- reputation-gate.mjs's own
intentional fail-closed branch (`no_borrower_agent_id`) then rejected every borrower unconditionally
the instant any lender configured minScore>0/minJobCount>0, inverting G3's entire purpose.

